Standard tags name the regulation, pharmacopoeia or engineering code a system is built to.

- Markup: `<span class="aq-tag">ASME BPE</span>`. Group several in `<div class="aq-tags">`.
- Use the standard's own short name exactly as published: USP, Ph. Eur., JP, ASME BPE, GAMP 5, 21 CFR 211, EN 285, ISPE Baseline Guide Vol. 4.
- Tags are informational, not buttons. If a tag links to the Compliance page, wrap it in an `<a>` and keep the same look.
- Only list standards a system genuinely meets. These are the only pill shapes in the system (`radius-pill`).

## Motion

Tags have no choreography of their own: they arrive with their host (LimitGauges pops its basis tags after the needle settles). A linked tag (`a.aq-tag`) eases its border on hover and shows the focus ring.
